\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces System classes on which the Q/R/M/C contract is evaluated, and where each is reported. The single symbolic agent is the first row; the communicating collective, the learned-communication policies, and the local LLM agents are rows two to four (all instrumented within \S  \ref {p1:sec:multi}); the three third-party agent stacks are the last row. ``Stage observability'' records whether the four conditional rates separate: full where an explicit query/lock interface exists, collapsed where a learned channel removes it, and marginal (non-nested event frequencies $f(\cdot )$) where only a tool trace is available.}}{6}{table.1}\protected@file@percent }
